   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Arrangement** es un evento; **foredrag**, una charla o conferencia. **Kulturhus** es un centro cultural. **Gratis** significa que no cuesta dinero.",
     "@en": "**Arrangement** is an event; **foredrag** is a talk or conference. **Kulturhus** is a cultural center. **Gratis** means it doesn't cost money."
    }
   ]
  },
